Subject: [PATCH] vesembedded: add experimental Akai CD3000XL

CD3000XL is provided by the existing upstream akai/s3000.cpp translation unit
and uses the same floppy connector and image-device option as S3000XL.  Add
only its lexically sorted embedded driver-registry entries.

diff --git a/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp b/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
--- a/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
+++ b/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
@@ -35,5 +35,6 @@ GAME_EXTERN(vfxsd);
 
 GAME_EXTERN(ap10);
+GAME_EXTERN(cd3000xl);
 GAME_EXTERN(ct8000);
 GAME_EXTERN(ctfk1);
 GAME_EXTERN(cz1);
@@ -76,6 +77,7 @@ const game_driver *const driver_list::s_drivers_sorted[] =
 {
 	&GAME_NAME(___empty),
 	&GAME_NAME(ap10),
+	&GAME_NAME(cd3000xl),
 	&GAME_NAME(ct8000),
 	&GAME_NAME(ctfk1),
 	&GAME_NAME(cz1),
